  "body": "## Summary\n- keep the implementation based exactly on the stable 2026-09-06 snapshot (`100ebca`)\n- for `VINTED_MODEL`, trust the exact category/brand/model/price filters already applied by Vinted instead of rejecting filtered catalog rows again with the title matcher\n- keep strict title/URL validation for `SEARCH_QUERY` and always reject obvious accessory listings there, including when the category is resolved and the primary strategy is `DICTIONARY_FILTERS`\n- resolve actual listing publication time for newly observed offers: prefer exact Vinted structured timestamps, then fall back to the visible `Dodane` age, and finally to observer first-seen time\n- count confirmed `FIRST_OFFER` actions per model for the previous full week\n- show real negotiation starts as a separate column in the model price matrix and remove the `1 bot = 35 nowych rozmów/tydz.` note\n- restore the exact historical V37/V38 Flyway migrations for databases that already ran the later pre-rollback branch, then use V39 for the new observer schema and normalize any persisted `CAPTCHA_REQUIRED` runtime rows back to stable `ERROR`\n\n## Scope\nThe normal `ListingScanner` remains byte-for-byte on the stable `100ebca` implementation. Publication-time enrichment and the accessory rule are applied from `MarketStatsCollector`; normal bot session/login/worker/CAPTCHA implementation is not changed.\n\n## Validation\n- Frontend lint/build: passed\n- Backend tests on a fresh PostgreSQL service, including Flyway migrations: passed\n- Playwright unit tests: passed\n- final CI run #502: passed\n- changed-file review confirms no normal bot session/login/worker implementation files are included",
